    "summary": "The Psychophage has Move 12″ and gains SMOKE. Its talons and betentacled maw profile has 6 Attacks and AP -2. After the Psychophage shoots in your Shooting phase, Bio-stimulus can mark one enemy unit it hit. Until the turn ends, melee attacks by TYRANIDS models from your army against that enemy improve their AP by 1. Each enemy unit can be marked once per turn.",
